   $q$The inn "built around a courtyard" in Text 1 is an example of what Text 2 calls a:$q$, $q$[{"text":"harbor","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"caravanserai","is_correct":true},{"text":"network","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"oasis","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-terms"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$caravanserai$q$, $q$Text 2 says caravans stopped at roadside inns called caravanserais, and Liang rests at such an inn. An oasis is the town where the inn stands, not the inn itself.$q$, 'draft', 'e2e4e3e6-d5e5-51ad-886e-212ec0064da4')
